			"notes": "- Update to 1.21.11 (and removed support for all older versions)\n- Adjusted fog using the new Environment attribute system:\n  - Default is less dense than vanilla nether\n  - Lava rivers and oceans have especially far view distance\n  - Soul sand valley, ghost forest, and basalt delta has fog equal to vanilla density\n  - Very dense fog in caves\n  - Fog density slightly fluctuates over time in all biomes\n- Made clouds red and fluctuate in height\n- Small adjustments to ore density\n- Fixed treasure bastion support pillars\n- Removed DnT compat datapack as it was outdated. An updated compat datapack will be added back in the future."
		},
